a mesh of the boolean and its contours of intersection with the other mesh before the cut, with the boolean&apos;s data for an exact cut;
the contours can include lone ones (inside one face, crossing none of its edges), which cutMesh connects exactly only given
the boolean&apos;s sorting data, see sortData
